category: Devel
requires: libCatch2_3.16.1 pkg-config
sdesc: "Multi-paradigm test framework for C++ (development)"
ldesc: "Catch2 is a multi-paradigm test framework for C++. which also supports
Objective-C (and maybe C). It is primarily distributed as a single header
file, although certain extensions may require additional headers."
external-source: Catch2

